  <note xmi:id="_6RofTsmCEfClDv2KOrT7rQ" opaque="true" posX="32" posY="32" sizeHeight="161" sizeWidth="833" text="How it works:&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;1. Defined JmsComponent via Spring configuration with id &quot;activemq&quot; (See &quot;Spring&quot; view)&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;2. Defined another CamelContext via Spring configuration, &#xD;&#xA;&#x9;and added one route from &quot;vm:spring&quot; to &quot;activemq:queue:spring&quot; inside it.(See &quot;Spring&quot; view)&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;3. Added necessary libraries via Advanced setting at cMessagingEndpoint component (see &quot;Read_From_JMS&quot; component)&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;4. Added more Dependencies in Exported MANIFEST.MF (Right Click on item, select &quot;Edit Route MANIFEST&quot;)"/>
